SELECT path FROM obj WHERE type='SpartaCharacterData' AND (path LIKE '%Shell%' OR path LIKE '%Player%' OR path LIKE '%/Humans/%' OR path LIKE '%DarkForm%' OR path LIKE '%Darkform%' OR path LIKE '%Gragu%' OR path LIKE '%Tiel%' OR path LIKE '%Eredrim%' OR path LIKE '%Harros%' OR path LIKE '%Solomon%' OR path LIKE '%KnightLady%' OR path LIKE '%Necrophage%' OR path LIKE '%Smert%' OR path LIKE '%Thorn%' OR path LIKE '%Genessa%' OR path LIKE '%Hadern%') ORDER BY path
